{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"nets\":{\"big\":\"Y\",\"small\":\"Y\",\"core\":\"Y\",\"concise\":\"平\",\"human\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\",\"load\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"big/core：Y的重点短语覆盖了全曲各阶段，X在S03–04、S08–10、S12–13没有大字话块，单扫大字容易断档；Y更能串起从渴望亲近、试探、害怕失去到接受不确定性的过程，也更清楚地呈现亲密幸福与失去之痛交织的核心。small：Y的小字多数补充了人物念头、因果和前后承接，X有些感受与大字表达近义重复，或与主线的挂接稍弱；human：判Y不是因为整句形式，而是X有“动作先露出了害怕”“光安静享受已经不够”“念头刚安静又冒出算了但还是放不下”等具体搭配和语序问题，Y虽然也有“这么好很久”等别扭表达，整体更符合日常说话习惯；load：Y的重点短语虽然数量多，但单块短、意群清楚，停留时间相对充足，X在S05、S07、S11、S14有多块较长的大字，扫读压力更大。concise：判平，X在S01、S06有退缩和孤单的大字小字近义复述，Y在S10、S11也有想哭与流泪、不藏喜欢与不再道歉等重复表达，两边都有冗余；fine：X胜，像失去支撑漂进雾里、白天相处很好而夜里独处泛酸、话到嘴边怕一说出口关系就变了，这些体验更具体、有辨识度，Y有些感受段落转而描述声部和旋律，或用高兴、没底等概括词代替更细腻的体验。\"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "97268a7d-462a-4988-a606-96a123718e3d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T185512354566Z", "elapsed_seconds": 314.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:00:26.527506+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "02474ce5c686c80256a706b09b3999d61365b506c72a9c4334922c4faa2237ed", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {